          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP480 - Carlisle Park Edmonton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Another one with some diviots around where i was searching, didnt take long to find the right spot though.  My 6th cap today, circling the whole city :)&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683858513">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-03T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3339080">Gimli*/GeoJoce</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP480 Carlisle Park Edmonton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After walking around Beaumaris Lake the geodog and I had time for one more cap before heading home and this was the one!  It took me a little longer to find this one....got distracted by a few other holes in the ground nearby.  I was just about to check out some context pictures when I looked up and spotted the cap. Yes!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A couple of pics with the boy while we rested a bit at the cap site and then we were on for home.  Nice night for a couple of walks and caps.  TFTBC OFTH!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683457488">
